        "type": "text",
        "text": "Official statistics for Norway from Statbank, the database of Statistics Norway (SSB). This server is not affiliated with or endorsed by SSB.\n\nTo answer a question with data:\n1. Call `search_tables` with short topic keywords. Norwegian titles (\"no\") are the most complete; try \"en\" if the user writes in English, and try the other language when results are poor. Table ids are five-digit table numbers.\n2. Call `get_table_metadata` on the best table to see its variables and value codes. Use `valueFilter` to find a municipality, county or industry by name.\n3. Call `query_table` with only the values you need. Use `latest` for recent periods.\n\nSSB allows about 40 API calls per minute, so avoid unnecessary calls. Always cite the source line that each result ends with. If you calculate new figures from the data, say they are your own calculation based on SSB data."
      }
    ],
    "messages": [
      {
        "role": "user",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Hvor høy er arbeidsledigheten i Norge nå?"
